  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual taunt as the aggressor",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'you want a fight?' and the subsequent vulgar taunt, as the text directly addresses an implied 'you' (the viewer or opponent). The user is positioned as the target of the aggressive challenge, and the meme invites the user to imagine themselves as the one being provoked or insulted. The projection is onto the textual material, which contains the deictic 'you' and 'your head', creating an implicit identification with the recipient of the taunt.",
